    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a thrilling first person bio shooting game! Here, you will transform into a soldier and embark on dangerous missions on different battlefields. Each game consists of multiple rounds, and at the beginning of each round, you will be randomly assigned to either the human or infected faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Human camp</strong>: As a human soldier, you need to resist fierce attacks from infected individuals. Reasonably utilize soldier skills and supply boxes, wait for the best opportunity, become a hero on the battlefield, deal fatal blows to infected individuals, and achieve permanent killing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infected camp</strong>: As an infected person, your goal is to infect as many humans as possible. After being killed by a firing weapon, you will be resurrected and become even stronger. Take advantage of the resurrection opportunity to gradually defeat human heroes and expand your infection range!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the game ends, you will receive gold coin rewards, which can be used to unlock new soldiers or infected individuals, purchase powerful weapons, and prepare adequately for the next game, striving for higher scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us and experience an unprecedented biochemical showdown. Who will be the ultimate winner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
